gr-file-recorder (0.1.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * First public release.
  * On-demand QT GUI recording sink with templated filenames.
  * Built-in tokens: {date}, {counter}, {type}, {freq}, {{var}}.
  * Push and toggle button modes with optional name prefix.
  * Optional resolved-filename label next to the button.
  * Auto-stop on duration or file-size limits.
  * Tilde expansion and parent directory auto-creation.
  * Pure-Python OOT module — no C++ build required.
  * 112 tests covering all input types, vlen values, and Qt interaction.

 -- Oleksandr Suvorov <cryosay@gmail.com>  Tue, 05 May 2026 16:00:00 +0300
